sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Client
    participant Lambda as AWS Lambda
    participant Resolver as Policy Resolver
    participant Cache as Local TTL Cache
    participant DynamoDB as DynamoDB
    participant Limiter as RateLimiter
    participant Algorithm as Rate-Limit Algorithm
    participant Registry as ScriptRegistry
    participant Valkey as ElastiCache / Valkey
    participant CloudWatch as CloudWatch

    Client->>Lambda: Invoke { policy_id }

    Lambda->>Lambda: Validate policy_id

    alt policy_id missing
        Lambda-->>Client: invalid_request
    else policy_id present
        Lambda->>Resolver: get_policy(policy_id)

        Resolver->>Cache: Lookup policy_id

        alt Policy cached
            Cache-->>Resolver: RateLimitPolicy
        else Cache miss
            Resolver->>DynamoDB: GetItem(policy_id)
            DynamoDB-->>Resolver: Policy record
            Resolver->>Resolver: Build RateLimitPolicy
            Resolver->>Cache: Cache policy
        end

        Resolver-->>Lambda: RateLimitPolicy

        alt Policy disabled
            Lambda-->>Client: rate_limiting_disabled
        else Policy enabled
            Lambda->>Limiter: allow(RateLimitRequest)

            Limiter->>Limiter: Select policy.algorithm
            Limiter->>Algorithm: allow(request)

            Note over Algorithm,Valkey: Algorithm adapter validates policy<br/>and constructs KEYS / ARGV

            Algorithm->>Valkey: Execute registered Lua script

            Note over Valkey: Atomic state transition<br/>Token Bucket / Fixed Window / Sliding Window

            Valkey-->>Algorithm: [allowed, remaining]
            Algorithm-->>Limiter: RateLimitResponse
            Limiter-->>Lambda: RateLimitResponse

            Lambda->>CloudWatch: EMF metrics
            Lambda->>CloudWatch: Structured log event

            alt Request allowed
                Lambda-->>Client: allowed=true, remaining
            else Rate limit exceeded
                Lambda-->>Client: allowed=false, remaining
            end
        end
    end


